---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Case Studies" description="See how Erdem has helped manufacturers, SACCOs, and insurers transform their data into decisions.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container">
    <span class="label">Our Work</span>
    <h1>From raw data to <span class="cyan">real decisions.</span></h1>
    <p style="margin-top:16px;max-width:520px;">Three engagements across manufacturing, financial services, and insurance — showing what Erdem builds and the results it delivers.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;">
    <a href="/case-studies/feed-manufacturer" class="cs-card">
      <div>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px;"><span class="tag">Manufacturing</span><span style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--dim);">Client Engagement</span></div>
        <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.3;">From Paper Registers to Remote-Ready Dashboards</h2>
        <p style="font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.7;">A Nairobi-based animal feed manufacturer eliminated a week-long reporting process with an automated Python-to-Power BI pipeline. The business is now managed fully remotely.</p>
        <div class="cs-metrics"><div><span class="cs-mv">7 days → 1 hr</span><span class="cs-ml">Reporting time</span></div><div><span class="cs-mv">2 weeks</span><span class="cs-ml">Delivery</span></div><div><span class="cs-mv">Retainer</span><span class="cs-ml">Model</span></div></div>
        <span style="font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--cyan);display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;">Read Case Study →</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-img"><img src="/images/dashboards/all.jpg" alt="Manufacturing dashboard" style="object-position:top;"/></div>
    </a>
    <a href="/case-studies/sacco" class="cs-card from-right">
      <div>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px;"><span class="tag">SACCO</span><span style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--dim);">Illustrative Example</span></div>
        <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.3;">From Ledger Books to Loan Intelligence</h2>
        <p style="font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.7;">A Kenyan SACCO automated SASRA compliance reporting, built an early-warning default model, and reduced loan defaults by 31% in six months.</p>
        <div class="cs-metrics"><div><span class="cs-mv">31%</span><span class="cs-ml">Default reduction</span></div><div><span class="cs-mv">3 wks → 1 day</span><span class="cs-ml">SASRA report</span></div><div><span class="cs-mv">Retainer</span><span class="cs-ml">Model</span></div></div>
        <span style="font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--cyan);display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;">Read Case Study →</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-img"><img src="/images/dashboards/all.jpg" alt="SACCO dashboard" style="object-position:center;"/></div>
    </a>
    <a href="/case-studies/insurance" class="cs-card">
      <div>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px;"><span class="tag">Insurance</span><span style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--dim);">Illustrative Example</span></div>
        <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.3;">Turning Claims Chaos into Compliance Clarity</h2>
        <p style="font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.7;">A Kenyan insurer automated claims reporting, flagged 18% of their backlog as fraudulent via AI, and gained real-time visibility across all branches.</p>
        <div class="cs-metrics"><div><span class="cs-mv">18%</span><span class="cs-ml">Fraud flagged</span></div><div><span class="cs-mv">5 days → 2 hrs</span><span class="cs-ml">Report time</span></div><div><span class="cs-mv">Retainer</span><span class="cs-ml">Model</span></div></div>
        <span style="font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--cyan);display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;">Read Case Study →</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-img"><img src="/images/dashboards/all.jpg" alt="Insurance dashboard" style="object-position:bottom;"/></div>
    </a>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section s-mid" style="text-align:center;"><div class="container">
    <h2 style="margin-bottom:14px;">Your organization could be next.</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--muted);max-width:420px;margin:0 auto 32px;">Tell us what you're working with and we'll show you what Erdem would build for you.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-cyan">Start a Conversation →</a>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
